('111.27.b.6.B',4,'To simulate guessing on a true/false question, you could...','["roll a die and count 3", "spin a spinner with 5 sections", "draw from 10 cards", "flip a coin"]'::jsonb,3,'True/false has two equal outcomes.','original'),
